    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 61,
        "endIndex": 525,
        "text": "### **Candidate [3] — Ramp raises $1.85B at a $60B valuation, reaching $2B in annualized revenue**\n* **Publisher:** Bloomberg / Company Announcement\n* **Scope:** IN SCOPE (Fintech / AI)\n* **What is confirmed:** On October 15, 2026, corporate spend and financial operations platform Ramp officially announced a $1.85 billion primary financing round led by Dragoneer Investment Group, with co-leaders Thrive Capital, Founders Fund, Sands Capital, and Avenir Growth"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 527,
        "endIndex": 563,
        "text": "The round values Ramp at $60 billion"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 565,
        "endIndex": 656,
        "text": "Ramp also confirmed it has crossed $2 billion in annualized revenue with positive cash flow"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 658,
        "endIndex": 864,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** While early details of the funding leaked to Bloomberg and other outlets earlier in October, the official press release and formal company announcement took place today (October 15)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
